# CarLink release R8 rules (phase 1: shrink + optimize, no renaming).
# design/RESEARCH_2026-10_R8_PLATFORM.md has the plan; docs/LOW_END_PERFORMANCE.md the numbers.
# R8 writes the merged configuration it ran with to
# app/build/outputs/mapping/release/configuration.txt (AGP's -printconfiguration).
#
# Rules for engine classes live in the engines' consumer files (vendor/diplay/shared,
# vendor/diauto/app), so a launcher reusing :carlink-core gets them too. CarLink's own code needs
# no member keeps: its manifest components are kept by AAPT2, its enums are looked up with direct
# valueOf/entries calls, and none of it is reached by reflection or JNI.

# No renaming: DiPlay's diagnostics (P2pConfigBuildDiagnostics, MediaFailureSummary) filter stack
# frames by package name, and logs shared from the tablet must stay readable without a mapping.
# Phase 2 revisits this with a mapping.txt kept per release.
-dontobfuscate

# Readable stack traces in carlink.log, diplay.log and DiAuto's journal.
-keepattributes SourceFile,LineNumberTable
# Class.getSimpleName() of nested classes (stage and failure names in the diagnostics) and
# generic signatures. In R8 full mode these survive only on classes matched by a keep rule,
# which the class-identity rules below provide for the app's and engines' classes.
-keepattributes Signature,InnerClasses,EnclosingMethod,*Annotation*

# Class identity: names must stay true, not only unrenamed. Without these rules R8's horizontal
# class merging folds classes into unrelated ones even with -dontobfuscate (first R8 build:
# com.carlink.core.connection.ConnectionProfiles and DiPlay's LiveVideoMeter merged into
# androidx.lifecycle.ViewModelLazy; CarLink composables' static methods moved into
# kotlin.ExceptionsKt), so stack frames, javaClass.name/simpleName in the diagnostics and DiPlay's
# package-filtered frames would name the wrong class. These rules keep no class and no member:
# allowshrinking lets unused classes go, and members are still shrunk, inlined and optimized; only
# merging and class inlining of these classes stop. Cost: +0.6 % dex (LOW_END_PERFORMANCE.md).
-keep,allowshrinking,allowobfuscation,allowaccessmodification class com.carlink.**
-keep,allowshrinking,allowobfuscation,allowaccessmodification class com.shilapi.**
-keep,allowshrinking,allowobfuscation,allowaccessmodification class com.andrerinas.**
-keep,allowshrinking,allowobfuscation,allowaccessmodification class com.byd.spi.**
